The simulator models LSX-64V as 4-lane 32-bit SIMD operations. This is a subset of LoongArch's full LSX which includes 128-bit operations across multiple data types.
3.5 Binary Translation Assist Extension (LSX-64BT)
Inspired by LoongArch's LBT extension (Loongson product page), LSX-64BT provides instructions to accelerate binary translation from other ISAs (x86, ARM):
Instruction
