LSX-64BT is specified but not implemented in the simulator. Its presence in the specification demonstrates the architecture's compatibility-first design philosophy.
  

4. Pipeline Architecture
4.1 Pipeline Overview
LSX-64 uses a 7-stage in-order scalar pipeline with forwarding. The pipeline depth is chosen to balance clock frequency and branch penalty, drawing from the deeper pipeline trends in modern Loongson cores (LA664 features a deeper pipeline than its predecessor LA464, per Tom's Hardware).
┌──────┐    ┌──────┐    ┌─────────┐    ┌──────┐    ┌───────┐    ┌───────┐    ┌──────┐
│ IF1  │───▶│ IF2  │───▶│ ID / RF │───▶│  EX  │───▶│ MEM1  │───▶│ MEM2  │───▶│  WB  │
│Fetch │    │Cache │    │Decode   │    │Exec  │    │D-Cache│    │Align │    │Write │
│ Req  │    │Resp  │    │Reg Read │    │      │    │  Acc  │    │ WB   │    │ Back │
└──────┘    └──────┘    └─────────┘    └──────┘    └───────┘    └───────┘    └──────┘

